## MTA-STS Policy

The MTA-STS policy file (.well-known/mta-sts.txt) is a configuration file
that follows RFC 8461 specifications. This file defines email security
requirements and is not subject to copyright.

## Documentation

All documentation files (*.md) in this repository are provided under the
MIT License for educational and reference purposes. You are free to use,
modify, and adapt these documents for your own MTA-STS deployments.

